# Button icons

Every `Button` includes one icon from `lucide-react`. Text-only buttons are incomplete.

Put the icon before the label with `data-icon="inline-start"`, or after it with `data-icon="inline-end"`. Leave sizing to `buttonVariants`. Do not add `size-*`, `w-*`, `h-*`, or margin classes on the icon.

Icon-only buttons use `size="icon"` (or `icon-sm` / `icon-lg` / `icon-xs`) and an `sr-only` label.

```tsx
import { ArrowRight, Send } from "lucide-react"
import { Button } from "@/components/ui/button"

<Button type="submit">
  <Send data-icon="inline-start" />
  Send note
</Button>

<Button>
  Next
  <ArrowRight data-icon="inline-end" />
</Button>

<Button type="button" variant="ghost" size="icon">
  <Send />
  <span className="sr-only">Send</span>
</Button>
```
